lly now.'=>'您有图片正在等待拉取。请等待自动拉取完成，或立即手动拉取。','Clean all orphaned post meta records'=>'清理所有孤立的文章元数据记录','Orphaned Post Meta'=>'孤立的文章元数据','Best available WordPress performance'=>'最佳 WordPress 性能','Clean orphaned post meta successfully.'=>'已成功清理孤立的文章元数据。','Last Pulled'=>'上次拉取','You can list the 3rd party vary cookies here.'=>'您可以在此列出第三方 Vary Cookie。','Vary Cookies'=>'Vary Cookie','Preconnecting speeds up future loads from a given origin.'=>'预连接可以加快后续从指定源加载内容的速度。','If your theme does not use JS to update the mini cart, you must enable this option to display the correct cart contents.'=>'如果您的主题不使用 JS 更新迷你购物车，则必须启用此选项才能显示正确的购物车内容。','Generate a separate vary cache copy for the mini cart when the cart is not empty.'=>'当购物车不为空时，为迷你购物车生成单独的 Vary 缓存副本。','Vary for Mini Cart'=>'迷你购物车 Vary','DNS Preconnect'=>'DNS 预连接','This setting is %1$s for certain qualifying requests due to %2$s!'=>'由于 %2$s，此设置对某些符合条件的请求处于 %1$s 状态！','URL Search'=>'URL 搜索','JS Delayed Includes'=>'JS 延迟包含项','Your domain_key has been temporarily blocklisted to prevent abuse. You may contact support at QUIC.cloud to learn more.'=>'为防止滥用，您的域名密钥已被暂时列入阻止列表。您可以联系 QUIC.cloud 支持团队了解详情。','Cloud server refused the current request due to unpulled images. Please pull the images first.'=>'由于存在未拉取的图片，云服务器拒绝了当前请求。请先拉取图片。','Current server load'=>'当前服务器负载','Started async image optimization request'=>'已开始异步图片优化请求','Started async crawling'=>'已开始异步爬取','Saving option failed. IPv4 only for %s.'=>'选项保存失败。%s 仅支持 IPv4。','Cloud server refused the current request due to rate limiting. Please try again later.'=>'由于速率限制，云服务器拒绝了当前请求。请稍后再试。','Maximum image post id'=>'最大图片文章 ID','Current image post id position'=>'当前图片文章 ID 位置','Images ready to request'=>'待请求的图片','Redetect'=>'重新检测','If you are using a %1$s socket, %2$s should be set to %3$s'=>'如果您使用的是 %1$s 套接字，则应将 %2$s 设置为 %3$s','All QUIC.cloud service queues have been cleared.'=>'所有 QUIC.cloud 服务队列均已清除。','Cache key must be integer or non-empty string, %s given.'=>'缓存键必须是整数或非空字符串，但提供的是 %s。','Cache key must not be an empty string.'=>'缓存键不能是空字符串。','JS Deferred / Delayed Excludes'=>'JS 推迟/延迟排除项','The queue is processed asynchronously. It may take time.'=>'队列将以异步方式处理，可能需要一些时间。','In order to use QC services, need a real domain name, cannot use an IP.'=>'要使用 QC 服务，需要真实的域名，不能使用 IP。','Restore Settings'=>'恢复设置','This will restore the backup settings created %1$s before applying the %2$s preset. Any changes made since then will be lost. Do you want to continue?'=>'这将恢复在应用 %2$s 预设之前创建的备份设置（%1$s）。此后所做的所有更改都将丢失。是否继续？','Backup created %1$s before applying the %2$s preset'=>'在应用 %2$s 预设之前创建的备份（%1$s）','Applied the %1$s preset %2$s'=>'已应用 %1$s 预设（%2$s）','Restored backup settings %1$s'=>'已恢复备份设置（%1$s）','Error: Failed to apply the settings %1$s'=>'错误：无法应用设置（%1$s）','History'=>'历史记录','Apply Preset'=>'应用预设','This will back up your current settings and replace them with the %1$s preset settings. Do you want to continue?'=>'这将备份您当前的设置，并将其替换为 %1$s 预设的设置。是否继续？','Who should use this preset?'=>'谁适合使用此预设？','Use an official LiteSpeed-designed Preset to configure your site in one click. Try no-risk caching essentials, extreme optimization, or something in between.'=>'使用 LiteSpeed 官方设计的预设，一键配置您的站点。您可以尝试零风险的基础缓存、极致优化，或介于两者之间的方案。','LiteSpeed Cache Standard Presets'=>'LiteSpeed Cache 标准预设','A QUIC.cloud connection is required to use this preset. Enables the maximum level of optimizations for improved page speed scores.'=>'使用此预设需要连接 QUIC.cloud。启用最高级别的优化，以提升页面速度评分。','This preset almost certainly will require testing and exclusions for some CSS, JS and Lazy Loaded images. Pay special attention to logos, or HTML-based slider images.'=>'此预设几乎肯定需要进行测试，并需要为部分 CSS、JS 和延迟加载的图片设置排除项。请特别留意 Logo 或基于 HTML 的幻灯片图片。','Inline CSS added to Combine'=>'内联 CSS 已加入合并','Inline JS added to Combine'=>'内联 JS 已加入合并','JS Delayed'=>'JS 延迟','Viewport Image Generation'=>'视口图片生成','Lazy Load for Images'=>'图片延迟加载','Everything in Aggressive, Plus'=>'包含「激进」的所有内容，以及','Extreme'=>'极致','This preset might work out of the box for some websites, but be sure to test! Some CSS or JS exclusions may be necessary in Page Optimization > Tuning.'=>'此预设对某些网站可能开箱即用，但请务必进行测试！可能需要在「页面优化 > 调优」中排除部分 CSS 或 JS。','Lazy Load for Iframes'=>'Iframe 延迟加载','Removed Unused CSS for Users'=>'为用户移除未使用的 CSS','Asynchronous CSS Loading with Critical CSS'=>'使用关键 CSS 异步加载 CSS','CSS & JS Combine'=>'CSS 和 JS 合并','Everything in Advanced, Plus'=>'包含「高级」的所有内容，以及','Aggressive'=>'激进','A QUIC.cloud connection is required to use this preset. Includes many optimizations known to improve page speed scores.'=>'使用此预设需要连接 QUIC.cloud。包含许多已知可提升页面速度评分的优化。','This preset is good for most websites, and is unlikely to cause conflicts. Any CSS or JS conflicts may be resolved with Page Optimization > Tuning tools.'=>'此预设适用于大多数网站，不太可能引发冲突。任何 CSS 或 JS 冲突都可以通过「页面优化 > 调优」中的工具解决。','Remove Query Strings from Static Files'=>'移除静态文件中的查询字符串','DNS Prefetch for static files'=>'静态文件 DNS 预获取','JS Defer for both external and inline JS'=>'推迟外部和内联 JS','CSS, JS and HTML Minification'=>'CSS、JS 和 HTML 压缩','Guest Mode and Guest Optimization'=>'访客模式和访客优化','Everything in Basic, Plus'=>'包含「基础」的所有内容，以及','Advanced (Recommended)'=>'高级（推荐）','A QUIC.cloud connection is required to use this preset. Includes optimizations known to improve site score in page speed measurement tools.'=>'使用此预设需要连接 QUIC.cloud。包含已知可提升站点在页面速度测试工具中评分的优化。','This low-risk preset introduces basic optimizations for speed and user experience. Appropriate for enthusiastic beginners.'=>'此低风险预设引入了针对速度和用户体验的基础优化，适合热衷尝试的新手。','Mobile Cache'=>'移动端缓存','Everything in Essentials, Plus'=>'包含「必要」的所有内容，以及','A QUIC.cloud connection is not required to use this preset. Only basic caching features are enabled.'=>'使用此预设无需连接 QUIC.cloud。仅启用基本的缓存功能。','This no-risk preset is appropriate for all websites. Good for new users, simple websites, or cache-oriented development.'=>'此零风险预设适用于所有网站，适合新用户、简单网站或以缓存为主的开发。','Higher TTL'=>'更高的 TTL','Default Cache'=>'默认缓存','Essentials'=>'必要','LiteSpeed Cache Configuration Presets'=>'LiteSpeed Cache 配置预设','Standard Presets'=>'标准预设','Listed CSS files will be excluded from UCSS and saved to inline.'=>'列出的 CSS 文件将从 UCSS 中排除，并以内联方式保存。','UCSS Selector Allowlist'=>'UCSS 选择器允许列表','Presets'=>'预设','Partner Benefits Provided by'=>'合作伙伴福利提供方','LiteSpeed Logs'=>'LiteSpeed 日志','Crawler Log'=>'爬虫日志','Purge Log'=>'清除日志','Prevent writing log entries that include listed strings.'=>'不写入包含所列字符串的日志条目。','View Site Before Cache'=>'查看缓存前的站点','View Site Before Optimization'=>'查看优化前的站点','Debug Helpers'=>'调试助手','Enable Viewport Images auto generation cron.'=>'启用「视口图片」自动生成计划任务。','This enables the page\'s initial screenful of imagery to be fully displayed without delay.'=>'这可以让页面首屏的图片无延迟地完整显示。','The Viewport Images service detects which images appear above the fold, and excludes them from lazy load.'=>'「视口图片」服务会检测哪些图片出现在首屏，并将它们排除在延迟加载之外。','When you use Lazy Load, it will delay the loading of all images on a page.'=>'使用延迟加载时，页面上所有图片的加载都会被延迟。','VPI'=>'VPI','%s must be turned ON for this setting to work.'=>'必须开启 %s，此设置才能生效。','Viewport Image'=>'视口图片','API: Filter %s available to disable blocklist.'=>'API：可使用过滤器 %s 停用阻止列表。','API: PHP Constant %s available to disable blocklist.'=>'API：可使用 PHP 常量 %s 停用阻止列表。','Please consider disabling the following detected plugins, as they may conflict with LiteSpeed Cache:'=>'请考虑停用检测到的以下插件，因为它们可能与 LiteSpeed Cache 冲突：','Mobile'=>'移动端','Disable VPI'=>'停用 VPI','Disable Image Lazyload'=>'停用图片延迟加载','Disable Cache'=>'停用缓存','Debug String Excludes'=>'调试字符串排除项','Viewport Images Cron'=>'视口图片计划任务','Viewport Images'=>'视口图片','Alias is in use by another QUIC.cloud account.'=>'该别名已被另一个 QUIC.cloud 账户使用。','Unable to automatically add %1$s as a Domain Alias for main %2$s domain.'=>'无法自动将 %1$s 添加为主域名 %2$s 的域名别名。','Unable to automatically add %1$s as a Domain Alias for main %2$s domain, due to potential CDN conflict.'=>'由于可能存在 CDN 冲突，无法自动将 %1$s 添加为主域名 %2$s 的域名别名。','You cannot remove this DNS zone, because it is still in use. Please update the domain\'s nameservers, then try to delete this zone again, otherwise your site will become inaccessible.'=>'此 DNS 区域仍在使用中，无法移除。请先更新该域名的域名服务器，然后再尝试删除此区域，否则您的站点将无法访问。','The site is not a valid alias on QUIC.cloud.'=>'该站点不是 QUIC.cloud 上的有效别名。','Please thoroughly test each JS file you add to ensure it functions as expected.'=>'请彻底测试您添加的每个 JS 文件，以确保其按预期运行。','Please thoroughly test all items in %s to ensure they function as expected.'=>'请彻底测试 %s 中的所有项目，以确保它们按预期运行。','Use %1$s to bypass UCSS for the pages which page type is %2$s.'=>'使用 %1$s 可为页面类型为 %2$s 的页面跳过 UCSS。','Use %1$s to generate one single UCSS for the pages which page type is %2$s while other page types still per URL.'=>'使用 %1$s 可为页面类型为 %2$s 的页面生成单一的 UCSS，而其他页面类型仍按 URL 生成。','Filter %s available for UCSS per page type generation.'=>'可使用过滤器 %s 按页面类型生成 UCSS。','Guest Mode failed to test.'=>'「访客模式」测试失败。','Guest Mode passed testing.'=>'「访客模式」测试通过。','Testing'=>'测试中','Guest Mode testing result'=>'访客模式测试结果','Not blocklisted'=>'未列入阻止列表','Learn more about when this is needed'=>'详细了解何时需要此功能','Cleaned all localized resource entries.'=>'已清理所有已本地化的资源条目。','View .htaccess'=>'查看 .htaccess','You can use this code %1$s in %2$s to specify the htaccess file path.'=>'您可以在 %2$s 中使用代码 %1$s 来指定 .htaccess 文件路径。','PHP Constant %s is supported.'=>'支持 PHP 常量 %s。','Default path is'=>'默认路径是','.htaccess Path'=>'.htaccess 路径','Please read all warnings before enabling this option.'=>'启用此选项前，请阅读所有警告。','This will delete all generated unique CSS files'=>'这将删除所有已生成的唯一 CSS 文件','In order to avoid an upgrade error, you must be using %1$s or later before you can upgrade to %2$s versions.'=>'为避免升级出错，您必须先使用 %1$s 或更高版本，才能升级到 %2$s 版本。','Use latest GitHub Dev/Master commit'=>'使用最新的 GitHub Dev/Master 提交','Press the %s button to use the most recent GitHub commit. Master is for release candidate & Dev is for experimental testing.'=>'点击 %s 按钮以使用最新的 GitHub 提交。Master 用于发行候选版本，Dev 用于实验性测试。','Downgrade not recommended. May cause fatal error due to refactored code.'=>'不建议降级。由于代码已重构，降级可能导致致命错误。','Only optimize pages for guest (not logged in) visitors. If turned this OFF, CSS/JS/CCSS files will be doubled by each user group.'=>'仅为访客（未登录用户）优化页面。如果关闭此选项，CSS/JS/CCSS 文件将按用户组成倍增加。','Listed JS files or inline JS code will not be optimized by %s.'=>'列出的 JS 文件或内联 JS 代码不会被 %s 优化。','Listed URI will not generate UCSS.'=>'列出的 URI 不会生成 UCSS。','The selector must exist in the CSS. Parent classes in the HTML will not work.'=>'选择器必须存在于 CSS 中。HTML 中的上级类不起作用。','Wildcard %s supported.'=>'支持通配符 %s。','Useful for above-the-fold images causing CLS (a Core Web Vitals metric).'=>'适用于导致 CLS（一项 Core Web Vitals 指标）的首屏图片。','Set an explicit width and height on image elements to reduce layout shifts and improve CLS (a Core Web Vitals metric).'=>'为图片元素设置明确的宽度和高度，以减少布局偏移并改善 CLS（一项 Core Web Vitals 指标）。','Changes to this setting do not apply to already-generated LQIPs. To regenerate existing LQIPs, please %s first from the admin bar menu.'=>'此设置的更改不会应用于已生成的 LQIP。如需重新生成现有 LQIP，请先从管理工具栏菜单中执行 %s。','Deferring until page is parsed or delaying till interaction can help reduce resource contention and improve performance causing a lower FID (Core Web Vitals metric).'=>'推迟到页面解析完成后再加载，或延迟到用户交互时再加载，有助于减少资源争用并提升性能，从而降低 FID（Core Web Vitals 指标）。','Delayed'=>'延迟','JS error can be found from the developer console of browser by right clicking and choosing Inspect.'=>'在浏览器中点击右键并选择「检查」，即可在开发者控制台中找到 JS 错误。','This option may result in a JS error or layout issue on frontend pages with certain themes/plugins.'=>'使用某些主题/插件时，此选项可能导致前端页面出现 JS 错误或布局问题。','This will also add a preconnect to Google Fonts to establish a connection earlier.'=>'这还会添加对 Google Fonts 的预连接，以便更早建立连接。','Delay rendering off-screen HTML elements by its selector.'=>'按选择器延迟渲染屏幕外的 HTML 元素。','Disable this option to generate CCSS per Post Type instead of per page. This can save significant CCSS quota, however it may result in incorrect CSS styling if your site uses a page builder.'=>'停用此选项可按文章类型而非按页面生成 CCSS。这可以节省大量 CCSS 配额，但如果您的站点使用页面构建器，可能会导致 CSS 样式错误。','Thi