iteSpeed 文档','There is proceeding queue not pulled yet. Queue info: %s.'=>'有正在处理的队列尚未拉取。队列信息：%s。','Specify how long, in seconds, Gravatar files are cached.'=>'指定 Gravatar 文件的缓存时长（秒）。','Cleared %1$s invalid images.'=>'已清除 %1$s 张无效图片。','LiteSpeed Cache General Settings'=>'LiteSpeed Cache 常规设置','This will delete all cached Gravatar files'=>'这将删除所有已缓存的 Gravatar 文件','Prevent any debug log of listed pages.'=>'不为列出的页面记录任何调试日志。','Only log listed pages.'=>'仅记录列出的页面。','Specify the maximum size of the log file.'=>'指定日志文件的最大大小。','To prevent filling up the disk, this setting should be OFF when everything is working.'=>'为避免占满磁盘，在一切运行正常时应将此设置设为「关」。','Press the %s button to stop beta testing and go back to the current release from the WordPress Plugin Directory.'=>'按下 %s 按钮可停止 Beta 测试，并返回 WordPress 插件目录中的当前发布版本。','Use latest WordPress release version'=>'使用最新的 WordPress 发布版本','OR'=>'或','Use this section to switch plugin versions. To beta test a GitHub commit, enter the commit URL in the field below.'=>'您可以在此部分切换插件版本。如需对某个 GitHub 提交进行 Beta 测试，请在下方字段中输入该提交的 URL。','Reset Settings'=>'重置设置','LiteSpeed Cache Toolbox'=>'LiteSpeed Cache 工具箱','Beta Test'=>'Beta 测试','Log View'=>'日志查看','Debug Settings'=>'调试设置','Turn ON to control heartbeat in backend editor.'=>'开启后可控制后台编辑器中的心跳。','Turn ON to control heartbeat on backend.'=>'开启后可控制后台的心跳。','Set to %1$s to forbid heartbeat on %2$s.'=>'设为 %1$s 可禁止 %2$s 的心跳。','WordPress valid interval is %s seconds.'=>'WordPress 的有效间隔为 %s 秒。','Specify the %s heartbeat interval in seconds.'=>'指定 %s 的心跳间隔（秒）。','Turn ON to control heartbeat on frontend.'=>'开启后可控制前台的心跳。','Disable WordPress interval heartbeat to reduce server load.'=>'停用 WordPress 的周期性心跳，以降低服务器负载。','Heartbeat Control'=>'心跳控制','provide more information here to assist the LiteSpeed team with debugging.'=>'在此提供更多信息，以协助 LiteSpeed 团队进行调试。','Optional'=>'可选','Generate Link for Current User'=>'为当前用户生成链接','Passwordless Link'=>'免密码链接','System Information'=>'系统信息','Go to plugins list'=>'前往插件列表','Install DoLogin Sec