 CSS'=>'关键 CSS','This site utilizes caching in order to facilitate a faster response time and better user experience. Caching potentially stores a duplicate copy of every web page that is on display on this site. All cache files are temporary, and are never accessed by any third party, except as necessary to obtain technical support from the cache plugin vendor. Cache files expire on a schedule set by the site administrator, but may easily be purged by the admin before their natural expiration, if necessary. We may use QUIC.cloud services to process & cache your data temporarily.'=>'本站点使用缓存来加快响应速度并提供更好的用户体验。缓存可能会为本站点上显示的每个网页存储一份副本。所有缓存文件都是临时的，除非为向缓存插件厂商获取技术支持而确有必要，否则任何第三方都不会访问这些文件。缓存文件会按照站点管理员设定的时间表过期，但如有必要，管理员也可以在其自然过期前轻松将其清除。我们可能会使用 QUIC.cloud 服务临时处理和缓存您的数据。','Disabling this may cause WordPress tasks triggered by AJAX to stop working.'=>'停用此项可能会导致由 AJAX 触发的 WordPress 任务停止工作。','right now'=>'现在','just now'=>'刚刚','Saved'=>'已保存','Last ran'=>'上次运行','You will be unable to Revert Optimization once the backups are deleted!'=>'删除备份后，您将无法还原优化！','This is irreversible.'=>'此操作不可逆。','Remove Original Image Backups'=>'移除原始图片备份','Are you sure you want to remove all image backups?'=>'您确定要移除所有图片备份吗？','Total'=>'总计','Files'=>'文件','Last calculated'=>'上次计算','Calculate Original Image Storage'=>'计算原始图片占用空间','Storage Optimization'=>'存储优化','Enable replacement of WebP/AVIF in %s elements that were generated outside of WordPress logic.'=>'对在 WordPress 逻辑之外生成的 %s 元素启用 WebP/AVIF 替换。','Use the format %1$s or %2$s (element is optional).'=>'使用 %1$s 或 %2$s 格式（元素部分可选）。','Only attributes listed here will be replaced.'=>'只有此处列出的属性会被替换。','Specify which element attributes will be replaced with WebP/AVIF.'=>'指定哪些元素属性将被替换为 WebP/AVIF。','WebP/AVIF Attribute To Replace'=>'要替换的 WebP/AVIF 属性','Only files within these directories will be pointed to the CDN.'=>'只有这些目录中的文件才会指向 CDN。','Included Directories'=>'包含的目录','A Purge All will be executed when WordPress runs these hooks.'=>'WordPress 运行这些钩子时，将执行「全部清除」。','Pur