d to communicate with Cloudflare'=>'无法与 Cloudflare 通信','Communicated with Cloudflare successfully.'=>'已成功与 Cloudflare 通信。','No available Cloudflare zone'=>'没有可用的 Cloudflare 区域','Notified Cloudflare to purge all successfully.'=>'已成功通知 Cloudflare 全部清除。','Cloudflare API is set to off.'=>'Cloudflare API 已设置为关闭。','Notified Cloudflare to set development mode to %s successfully.'=>'已成功通知 Cloudflare 将开发模式设置为 %s。','Once saved, it will be matched with the current list and completed automatically.'=>'保存后，将与当前列表进行匹配并自动补全。','You can just type part of the domain.'=>'您只需输入域名的一部分即可。','Domain'=>'域名','Cloudflare API'=>'Cloudflare API','Purge Everything'=>'清除所有内容','Cloudflare Cache'=>'Cloudflare 缓存','Development Mode will be turned off automatically after three hours.'=>'开发模式将在 3 小时后自动关闭。','Temporarily bypass Cloudflare cache. This allows changes to the origin server to be seen in realtime.'=>'暂时绕过 Cloudflare 缓存，以便实时查看源服务器上的更改。','Development mode will be automatically turned off in %s.'=>'开发模式将在 %s 后自动关闭。','Current status is %s.'=>'当前状态为 %s。','Current status is %1$s since %2$s.'=>'自 %2$s 起，当前状态为 %1$s。','Check Status'=>'检查状态','Turn OFF'=>'关闭','Turn ON'=>'开启','Development Mode'=>'开发模式','Cloudflare Zone'=>'Cloudflare 区域','Cloudflare Domain'=>'Cloudflare 域名','Cloudflare'=>'Cloudflare','For example'=>'例如','Prefetching DNS can reduce latency for visitors.'=>'预获取 DNS 可以降低访客的访问延迟。','DNS Prefetch'=>'DNS 预获取','Adding Style to Your Lazy-Loaded Images'=>'为延迟加载的图片添加样式','Default value'=>'默认值','Static file type links to be replaced by CDN links.'=>'要替换为 CDN 链接的静态文件类型链接。','For example, to drop parameters beginning with %1$s, %2$s can be used here.'=>'例如，要丢弃以 %1$s 开头的参数，可在此处使用 %2$s。','Drop Query String'=>'丢弃查询字符串','Enable this option if you are using both HTTP and HTTPS in the same domain and are noticing cache irregularities.'=>'如果您在同一域名下同时使用 HTTP 和 HTTPS，并发现缓存异常，请启用此选项。','Improve HTTP/HTTPS Compatibility'=>'改善 HTTP/HTTPS 兼容性','Remove all previous image optimization requests/results, revert completed optimizations, and delete all optimization files.'=>'移除之前所有的图片优化请求/结果，还原已完成的优化，并删除所有优化文件。','Destroy All Optimization Data'=>'销毁所有优化数据','Scan for any new unoptimized image thumbnail sizes and resend necessary image optimization requests.'=>'扫描所有新的未优化图片缩略图尺寸，并重新发送必要的图片优化请求。','This will increase the size of optimized files.'=>'这会增加优化后文件的大小。','Preserve EXIF data (copyright, GPS, comments, keywords, etc) when optimizing.'=>'优化时保留 EXIF 数据（版权、GPS、注释、关键词等）。','Clear Logs'=>'清除日志',' %s ago'=>' %s 前','WebP saved %s'=>'WebP 节省了 %s','If you run into any issues, please refer to the report number in your support message.'=>'如果遇到任何问题，请在支持请求中注明此报告编号。','Last pull initiated by cron at %s.'=>'上次拉取由计划任务于 %s 发起。','Images will be pulled automatically if the cron job is running.'=>'如果计划任务正在运行，图片将自动拉取。','Only press the button if the pull cron job is disabled.'=>'仅当拉取计划任务已停用时才需按下此按钮。','Pull Images'=>'拉取图片','This process is automatic.'=>'此过程会自动进行。','Last Request'=>'上次请求','Images Pulled'=>'已拉取的图片','Report'=>'报告','Send this report to LiteSpeed. Refer to this report number when posting in the WordPress support forum.'=>'将此报告发送给 LiteSpeed。在 WordPress 支持论坛发帖时，请提供此报告编号。','Send to LiteSpeed'=>'发送给 LiteSpeed','LiteSpeed Optimization'=>'LiteSpeed 优化','Load Google Fonts Asynchronously'=>'异步加载 Google Fonts','Browser Cache TTL'=>'浏览器缓存 TTL','Results can be checked in %sMedia Library%s.'=>'可在 %s媒体库%s 中查看结果。','Learn More'=>'了解更多','Image groups total'=>'图片组总数','Images optimized and pulled'=>'已优化并拉取的图片','Images requested'=>'已请求的图片','Switched to optimized file successfully.'=>'已成功切换到优化后的文件。','Restored original file successfully.'=>'已成功恢复原始文件。','Enabled WebP file successfully.'=>'已成功启用 WebP 文件。','Disabled WebP file successfully.'=>'已成功停用 WebP 文件。','Significantly improve load time by replacing images with their optimized %s versions.'=>'将图片替换为优化后的 %s 版本，从而显著缩短加载时间。','Selected roles will be excluded from cache.'=>'所选角色将被排除在缓存之外。','Tuning'=>'调优','Selected roles will be excluded from all optimizations.'=>'所选角色将被排除在所有优化之外。','Role Excludes'=>'角色排除项','Tuning Settings'=>'调优设置','If the tag slug is not found, the tag will be removed from the list on save.'=>'如果找不到该标签别名，保存时该标签将从列表中移除。','If the category name is not found, the category will be removed from the list on save.'=>'如果找不到该分类名称，保存时该分类将从列表中移除。','After the QUIC.cloud Image Optimization server finishes optimization, it will notify your site to pull the optimized images.'=>'QUIC.cloud 图片优化服务器完成优化后，会通知您的站点拉取优化后的图片。','Send Optimization Request'=>'发送优化请求','Image Information'=>'图片信息','Total Reduction'=>'总缩减量','Optimization Summary'=>'优化概要','LiteSpeed Cache Image Optimization'=>'LiteSpeed Cache 图片优化','Image Optimization'=>'图片优化','For example, %s can be used for a transparent placeholder.'=>'例如，可以使用 %s 作为透明占位符。','By default a gray image placeholder %s will be used.'=>'默认将使用灰色图片占位符 %s。','This can be predefined in %2$s as well using constant %1$s, with this setting taking priority.'=>'也可以在 %2$s 中通过常量 %1$s 预先定义此项，但本设置的优先级更高。','Specify a base64 image to be used as a simple placeholder while images finish loading.'=>'指定一张 base64 图片，在图片加载完成之前用作简单的占位符。','Elements with attribute %s in html code will be excluded.'=>'HTML 代码中带有 %s 属性的元素将被排除。','Filter %s is supported.'=>'支持过滤器 %s。','Listed images will not be lazy loaded.'=>'列出的图片将不会延迟加载。','Lazy Load Image Excludes'=>'延迟加载图片排除项','No optimization'=>'未优化','Prevent any optimization of listed pages.'=>'阻止对列出的页面进行任何优化。','URI Excludes'=>'URI 排除项','Stop loading WordPress.org emoji. Browser default emoji will be displayed instead.'=>'停止加载 WordPress.org 的 Emoji，改为显示浏览器默认的 Emoji。','Both full URLs and partial strings can be used.'=>'既可以使用完整的 URL，也可以使用部分字符串。','Load iframes only when they enter the viewport.'=>'仅在 iframe 进入视口时才加载。','Lazy Load Iframes'=>'延迟加载 Iframe','This can improve page loading time by reducing initial HTTP requests.'=>'这可以通过减少初始 HTTP 请求来缩短页面加载时间。','Load images only when they enter the viewport.'=>'仅在图片进入视口时才加载。','Lazy Load Images'=>'延迟加载图片','Media Settings'=>'媒体设置','For example, for %1$s, %2$s and %3$s can be used here.'=>'例如，对于 %1$s，可在此处使用 %2$s 和 %3$s。','Wildcard %1$s supported (match zero or more characters). For example, to match %2$s and %3$s, use %4$s.'=>'支持通配符 %1$s（匹配零个或多个字符）。例如，要匹配 %2$s 和 %3$s，请使用 %4$s。','To match the beginning, add %s to the beginning of the item.'=>'要匹配开头，请在该项的开头添加 %s。','For example, for %1$s, %2$s can be used here.'=>'例如，对于 %1$s，可在此处使用 %2$s。','Maybe later'=>'以后再说','I\'ve already left a review'=>'我已经评价过了','Welcome to LiteSpeed'=>'欢迎使用 LiteSpeed','Remove WordPress Emoji'=>'移除 WordPress Emoji','More settings'=>'更多设置','Private cache'=>'私有缓存','Non cacheable'=>'不可缓存','Mark this page as '=>'将此页面标记为','Purge this page'=>'清除此页面','Load JS Deferred'=>'推迟加载 JS','Specify critical CSS rules for above-the-fold content when enabling %s.'=>'启用 %s 时，为首屏内容指定关键 CSS 规则。','Critical CSS Rules'=>'关键 CSS 规则','Load CSS Asynchronously'=>'异步加载 CSS','Prevent Google Fonts from loading on all pages.'=>'阻止在所有页面上加载 Google Fonts。','Remove Google Fonts'=>'移除 Google Fonts','This can improve your speed score in services like Pingdom, GTmetrix and PageSpeed.'=>'这可以提高您在 Pingdom、GTmetrix 和 PageSpeed 等服务中的速度评分。','Remove query strings from internal static resources.'=>'移除内部静态资源中的查询字符串。','Remove Query Strings'=>'移除查询字符串','user agents'=>'用户代理','cookies'=>'cookie','You can turn on browser caching in server admin too. %sLearn more about LiteSpeed browser cache settings%s.'=>'您也可以在服务器管理面板中开启浏览器缓存。%s详细了解 LiteSpeed 浏览器缓存设置%s。','Browser caching stores static files locally in the user\'s browser. Turn on this setting to reduce repeated requests for static files.'=>'浏览器缓存会将静态文件存储在用户浏览器本地。开启此设置可减少对静态文件的重复请求。','Browser Cache'=>'浏览器缓存','tags'=>'标签','Do Not Cache Tags'=>'不缓存的标签','To exclude %1$s, insert %2$s.'=>'要排除 %1$s，请插入 %2$s。','categories'=>'分类','To prevent %s from being cached, enter them here.'=>'要防止 %s 被缓存，请在此处输入。','Do Not Cache Categories'=>'不缓存的分类','Query strings containing these parameters will not be cached.'=>'包含这些参数的查询字符串将不会被缓存。','Do Not Cache Query Strings'=>'不缓存的查询字符串','Paths containing these strings will not be cached.'=>'包含这些字符串的路径将不会被缓存。','Do Not Cache URIs'=>'不缓存的 URI','One per line.'=>'每行一个。','URI Paths containing these strings will NOT be cached as public.'=>'包含这些字符串的 URI 路径将不会存入公共缓存。','Private Cached URIs'=>'私有缓存的 URI','Paths containing these strings will not be served from the CDN.'=>'包含这些字符串的路径将不会通过 CDN 提供。','Exclude Path'=>'排除路径','Include File Types'=>'包含的文件类型','Serve all JavaScript files through the CDN. This will affect all enqueued WP JavaScript files.'=>'通过 CDN 提供所有 JavaScript 文件。这将影响所有已加入队列的 WordPress JavaScript 文件。','Include JS'=>'包含 JS','Serve all CSS files through the CDN. This will affect all enqueued WP CSS files.'=>'通过 CDN 提供所有 CSS 文件。这将影响所有已加入队列的 WordPress CSS 文件。','Include CSS'=>'包含 CSS','Serve all image files through the CDN. This will affect all attachments, HTML %1$s tags, and CSS %2$s attributes.'=>'通过 CDN 提供所有图片文件。这将影响所有附件、HTML %1$s 标签和 CSS %2$s 属性。','Include Images'=>'包含图片','CDN URL to be used. For example, %s'=>'要使用的 CDN URL。例如，%s','CDN URL'=>'CDN URL','Site URL to be served through the CDN. Beginning with %1$s. For example, %2$s.'=>'要通过 CDN 提供的站点 URL，以 %1$s 开头。例如，%2$s。','Original URLs'=>'原始 URL','CDN Settings'=>'CDN 设置','CDN'=>'CDN','OFF'=>'关','ON'=>'开','Notified LiteSpeed Web Server to purge CSS/JS entries.'=>'已通知 LiteSpeed Web Server 清除 CSS/JS 条目。','Minify HTML content.'=>'压缩 HTML 内容。','HTML Minify'=>'HTML 压缩','JS Excludes'=>'JS 排除项','JS Combine'=>'JS 合并','JS Minify'=>'JS 压缩','CSS Excludes'=>'CSS 排除项','CSS Combine'=>'CSS 合并','CSS Minify'=>'CSS 压缩','Please test thoroughly when enabling any option in this list. After changing Minify/Combine settings, please do a Purge All action.'=>'启用此列表中的任何选项时，请进行全面测试。更改压缩/合并设置后，请执行「全部清除」操作。','This will purge all minified/combined CSS/JS entries only'=>'这只会清除所有已压缩/合并的 CSS/JS 条目','Purge %s Error'=>'清除 %s 错误','Database Optimizer'=>'数据库优化器','Optimize all tables in your database'=>'优化数据库中的所有数据表','Optimize Tables'=>'优化数据表','Clean all transient options'=>'清理所有瞬态选项','All Transients'=>'所有瞬态数据','Clean expired transient options'=>'清理过期的瞬态选项','Expired Transients'=>'过期的瞬态数据','Clean all trackbacks and pingbacks'=>'清理所有 Trackback 和 Pingback','Trackbacks/Pingbacks'=>'Trackback/Pingback','Clean all trashed comments'=>'清理回收站中的所有评论','Trashed Comments'=>'回收站中的评论','Clean all spam comments'=>'清理所有垃圾评论','Spam Comments'=>'垃圾评论','Clean all trashed posts and pages'=>'清理回收站中的所有文章和页面','Trashed Posts'=>'回收站中的文章','Auto Drafts'=>'自动草稿','Clean all post revisions'=>'清理所有文章修订版本','Post Revisions'=>'文章修订版本','Clean All'=>'全部清理','Optimized all tables.'=>'已优化所有数据表。','Clean all transients successfully.'=>'已成功清理所有瞬态数据。','Clean expired transients successfully.'=>'已成功清理过期的瞬态数据。','Clean trackbacks and pingbacks successfully.'=>'已成功清理 Trackback 和 Pingback。','Clean trashed comments successfully.'=>'已成功清理回收站中的评论。','Clean spam comments successfully.'=>'已成功清理垃圾评论。','Clean trashed posts and pages successfully.'=>'已成功清理回收站中的文章和页面。','Clean auto drafts successfully.'=>'已成功清理自动草稿。','Clean post revisions successfully.'=>'已成功清理文章修订版本。','Clean all successfully.'=>'已成功全部清理。','Default Private Cache TTL'=>'默认私有缓存 TTL','If your site contains public content that certain user roles can see but other roles cannot, you can specify a Vary Group for those user roles. For example, specifying an administrator vary group allows there to be a separate publicly-cached page tailored to administrators (with “edit” links, etc), while all other user roles see the default public page.'=>'如果您的站点包含某些用户角色可见而其他角色不可见的公共内容，您可以为这些用户角色指定「Vary 组」。例如，指定管理员 Vary 组后，可以为管理员单独提供一个专门定制的公共缓存页面（包含「编辑」链接等），而其他所有用户角色看到的则是默认的公共页面。','Vary Group'=>'Vary 组','Cache the built-in Comment Form ESI block.'=>'缓存内置的评论表单 ESI 区块。','Cache Comment Form'=>'缓存评论表单','Cache the built-in Admin Bar ESI block.'=>'缓存内置的管理工具栏 ESI 区块。','Cache Admin Bar'=>'缓存管理工具栏','Turn ON to cache public pages for logged in users, and serve the Admin Bar and Comment Form via ESI blocks. These two blocks will be uncached unless enabled below.'=>'开启后，将为已登录用户缓存公共页面，并通过 ESI 区块提供管理工具栏和评论表单。除非在下方启用，否则这两个区块不会被缓存。','ESI allows you to designate parts of your dynamic page as separate fragments that are then assembled together to make the whole page. In other words, ESI lets you “punch holes” in a page, and then fill those holes with content that may be cached privately, cached publicly with its own TTL, or not cached at all.'=>'ESI 允许您将动态页面的各个部分指定为独立的片段，再将这些片段组合成完整的页面。换句话说，ESI 让您可以在页面上「打孔」，然后用可私有缓存、以自身 TTL 公共缓存或完全不缓存的内容来填补这些孔洞。','With ESI (Edge Side Includes), pages may be served from cache for logged-in users.'=>'借助 ESI（Edge Side Includes），可以从缓存中为已登录用户提供页面。','Private'=>'私有','Public'=>'公共','Purge Settings'=>'清除设置','Cache Mobile'=>'缓存移动端','Advanced level will log more details.'=>'「高级」级别会记录更详细的信息。','Basic'=>'基础','The maximum average server load allowed while crawling. The number of crawler threads in use will be actively reduced until average server load falls under this limit. If this cannot be achieved with a single thread, the current crawler run will be terminated.'=>'爬取时允许的最大平均服务器负载。爬虫会主动减少正在使用的线程数，直到平均服务器负载降至此限制以下。如果仅使用单个线程仍无法达到此目标，将终止本次爬虫运行。','Cache Login Page'=>'缓存登录页面','Cache requests made by WordPress REST API calls.'=>'缓存由 WordPress REST API 调用发出的请求。','Cache REST API'=>'缓存 REST API','Privately cache commenters that have pending comments. Disabling this option will serve non-cacheable pages to commenters. (LSWS %s required)'=>'为有待审核评论的评论者提供私有缓存。停用此选项后，将向评论者提供不可缓存的页面。（需要 LSWS %s）','Cache Commenters'=>'缓存评论者','Privately cache frontend pages for logged-in users. (LSWS %s required)'=>'为已登录用户私有缓存前台页面。（需要 LSWS %s）','Cache Logged-in Users'=>'缓存已登录用户','Cache Control Settings'=>'缓存控制设置','ESI'=>'ESI','Excludes'=>'排除项','Purge'=>'清除','Cache'=>'缓存','Unexpected cache rule %2$s found in %1$s file. This rule may cause visitors to see old versions of pages due to the browser caching HTML pages. If you are sure that HTML pages are not being browser cached, this message can be dismissed. (%3$sLearn More%4$s)'=>'在 %1$s 文件中发现意外的缓存规则 %2$s。由于浏览器会缓存 HTML 页面，此规则可能导致访客看到旧版本的页面。如果您确定 HTML 页面没有被浏览器缓存，可以忽略此消息。（%3$s了解更多%4$s）','Current server time is %s.'=>'当前服务器时间为 %s。','Specify the time to purge the "%s" list.'=>'指定清除「%s」列表的时间。','Both %1$s and %2$s are acceptable.'=>'%1$s 和 %2$s 均可。','Scheduled Purge Time'=>'计划清除时间','The URLs here (one per line) will be purged automatically at the time set in the option "%s".'=>'此处的 URL（每行一个）将在选项「%s」所设置的时间自动清除。','Scheduled Purge URLs'=>'计划清除的 URL','Shorten query strings in the debug log to improve readability.'=>'缩短调试日志中的查询字符串，以提高可读性。','Heartbeat'=>'心跳','MB'=>'MB','Log File Size Limit'=>'日志文件大小限制','<p>Please add/replace the following codes into the beginning of %1$s:</p> %2$s'=>'<p>请将以下代码添加或替换到 %1$s 的开头：</p> %2$s','%s file not writable.'=>'%s 文件不可写。','%s file not readable.'=>'%s 文件不可读。','Collapse Query Strings'=>'折叠查询字符串','ESI Settings'=>'ESI 设置','A TTL of 0 indicates do not cache.'=>'TTL 为 0 表示不缓存。','Recommended value: 28800 seconds (8 hours).'=>'推荐值：28800 秒（8 小时）。','Widget Cache TTL'=>'小工具缓存 TTL','Enable ESI'=>'启用 ESI','See %sIntroduction for Enabling the Crawler%s for detailed information.'=>'有关详细信息，请参阅 %s启用爬虫简介%s。','Custom Sitemap'=>'自定义站点地图','Purge pages by relative or full URL.'=>'按相对或完整 URL 清除页面。','The crawler feature is not enabled on the LiteSpeed server. Please consult your server admin or hosting provider.'=>'LiteSpeed 服务器未启用爬虫功能。请咨询您的服务器管理员或主机提供商。','WARNING'=>'警告','The next complete sitemap crawl will start at'=>'下一次完整站点地图爬取将开始于','Failed to write to %s.'=>'无法写入 %s。','Folder is not writable: %s.'=>'文件夹不可写：%s。','Can not create folder: %1$s. Error: %2$s'=>'无法创建文件夹：%1$s。错误：%2$s','Folder does not exist: %s'=>'文件夹不存在：%s','Notified LiteSpeed Web Server to purge the list.'=>'已通知 LiteSpeed Web Server 清除列表。','Please visit the %sInformation%s page on how to test the cache.'=>'请访问 %s信息%s 页面，了解如何测试缓存。','Allows listed IPs (one per line) to perform certain actions from their browsers.'=>'允许所列的 IP（每行一个）通过其浏览器执行特定操作。','Server Load Limit'=>'服务器负载限制','Specify how long in seconds before the crawler should initiate crawling the entire sitemap again.'=>'指定爬虫再次开始爬取整个站点地图之前的等待时长（以秒为单位）。','Crawl Interval'=>'爬取间隔','Then another WordPress is installed (NOT MULTISITE) at %s'=>'然后在 %s 安装了另一个 WordPress（非多站点）','LiteSpeed Cache Network Cache Settings'=>'LiteSpeed Cache 网络缓存设置','Select below for "Purge by" options.'=>'在下方选择「清除依据」选项。','LiteSpeed Cache CDN'=>'LiteSpeed Cache CDN','No crawler meta file generated yet'=>'尚未生成爬虫元文件','Show crawler status'=>'显示爬虫状态','Watch Crawler Status'=>'查看爬虫状态','Please see %sHooking WP-Cron Into the System Task Scheduler%s to learn how to create the system cron task.'=>'请参阅 %s将 WP-Cron 挂接到系统任务计划程序%s，了解如何创建系统计划任务。','Run frequency is set by the Interval Between Runs setting.'=>'运行频率由「运行间隔」设置决定。','Manually run'=>'手动运行','Reset position'=>'重置位置','Run Frequency'=>'运行频率','Cron Name'=>'计划任务名称','Crawler Cron'=>'爬虫计划任务','%d minute'=>'%d 分钟','%d minutes'=>'%d 分钟','%d hour'=>'%d 小时','%d hours'=>'%d 小时','Generated at %s'=>'生成于 %s','LiteSpeed Cache Crawler'=>'LiteSpeed Cache 爬虫','If there are any questions, the team is always happy to answer any questions on the %ssupport forum%s.'=>'如有任何疑问，我们的团队随时乐意在 %s支持论坛%s 上为您解答。','Crawler'=>'爬虫','https://www.litespeedtech.com/products/cache-plugins/wordpress-acceleration'=>'https://www.litespeedtech.com/products/cache-plugins/wordpress-acceleration','Notified LiteSpeed Web Server to purge all pages.'=>'已通知 LiteSpeed Web Server 清除所有页面。','All pages with Recent Posts Widget'=>'所有带有「近期文章」小工具的页面','Pages'=>'页面','This will Purge Pages only'=>'这只会清除页面','Purge Pages'=>'清除页面','Cancel'=>'取消','Deactivate'=>'停用','Activate'=>'启用','Email Address'=>'电子邮箱地址','Install Now'=>'立即安装','Purged the URL!'=>'已清除该 URL！','Notified LiteSpeed Web Server to purge error pages.'=>'已通知 LiteSpeed Web Server 清除错误页面。','If using OpenLiteSpeed, the server must be restarted once for the changes to take effect.'=>'如果使用 OpenLiteSpeed，需要重启一次服务器才能使更改生效。','If the login cookie was recently changed in the settings, please log out and back in.'=>'如果最近在设置中更改过登录 Cookie，请注销后重新登录。','However, there is no way of knowing all the possible customizations that were implemented.'=>'不过，我们无法得知所有可能已实施的自定义修改。','The LiteSpeed Cache plugin is used to cache pages - a simple way to improve the performance of the site.'=>'LiteSpeed Cache 插件用于缓存页面，这是提升站点性能的一种简单方法。','The network admin setting can be overridden here.'=>'可以在此处覆盖网络管理设置。','Specify how long, in seconds, public pages are cached.'=>'指定公共页面的缓存时长（以秒为单位）。','Specify how long, in seconds, private pages are cached.'=>'指定私有页面的缓存时长（以秒为单位）。','It is STRONGLY recommended that the compatibility with other plugins on a single/few sites is tested first.'=>'强烈建议先在单个或少数几个站点上测试与其他插件的兼容性。','Purge pages by post ID.'=>'按文章 ID 清除页面。','Purge the LiteSpeed cache entries created by this plugin'=>'清除由此插件创建的 LiteSpeed 缓存条目','Purge %s error pages'=>'清除 %s 错误页面','This will Purge Front Page only'=>'这只会清除首页','Purge pages by tag name - e.g. %2$s should be used for the URL %1$s.'=>'按标签名称清除页面，例如，对于 URL %1$s，应使用 %2$s。','Purge pages by category name - e.g. %2$s should be used for the URL %1$s.'=>'按分类名称清除页面，例如，对于 URL %1$s，应使用 %2$s。','If only the WordPress site should be purged, use Purge All.'=>'如果只需清除 WordPress 站点，请使用「全部清除」。','Notified LiteSpeed Web Server to purge everything.'=>'已通知 LiteSpeed Web Server 清除所有内容。','Use Primary Site Configuration'=>'使用主站点配置','This will disable the settings page on all subsites.'=>'这将停用所有子站点上的设置页面。','Check this option to use the primary site\'s configuration for all subsites.'=>'选中此选项，即可对所有子站点使用主站点的配置。','Save Changes'=>'保存更改','The following options are selected, but are not editable in this settings page.'=>'以下选项已被选中，但无法在此设置页面中编辑。','The network admin selected use primary site configs for all subsites.'=>'网络管理员已选择对所有子站点使用主站点配置。','Empty Entire Cache'=>'清空整个缓存','This action should only be used if things are cached incorrectly.'=>'仅当内容缓存不正确时才应使用此操作。','Clears all cache entries related to this site, including other web applications.'=>'清除与此站点相关的所有缓存条目，包括其他 Web 应用程序的缓存。','This may cause heavy load on the server.'=>'这可能会导致服务器负载过高。','This will clear EVERYTHING inside the cache.'=>'这将清除缓存中的所有内容。','LiteSpeed Cache Purge All'=>'LiteSpeed Cache 全部清除','If you would rather not move at litespeed, you can deactivate this plugin.'=>'如果您不想以光速（LiteSpeed）前进，可以停用此插件。','Create a post, make sure the front page is accurate.'=>'创建一篇文章，确认首页显示正确。','Visit the site while logged out.'=>'注销后访问站点。','Examples of test cases include:'=>'测试用例示例包括：','For that reason, please test the site to make sure everything still functions properly.'=>'因此，请测试站点，确保一切仍能正常运行。','This message indicates that the plugin was installed by the server admin.'=>'此消息表示该插件是由服务器管理员安装的。','LiteSpeed Cache plugin is installed!'=>'LiteSpeed Cache 插件已安装！','Debug Log'=>'调试日志','Admin IP Only'=>'仅限管理员 IP','The Admin IP option will only output log messages on requests from admin IPs listed below.'=>'「仅限管理员 IP」选项只会针对来自下方所列管理员 IP 的请求输出日志消息。','Specify how long, in seconds, REST calls are cached.'=>'指定 REST 调用的缓存时长（以秒为单位）。','The environment report contains detailed information about the WordPress configuration.'=>'环境报告包含有关 WordPress 配置的详细信息。','The server will determine if the user is logged in based on the existence of this cookie.'=>'服务器将根据此 Cookie 是否存在来判断用户是否已登录。','Note'=>'注意','To test the cart, visit the %sFAQ%s.'=>'要测试购物车，请访问 %s常问问题%s。','After verifying that the cache works in general, please test the cart.'=>'确认缓存总体上正常工作后，请测试购物车。','When enabled, the cache will automatically purge when any plugin, theme or the WordPress core is upgraded.'=>'启用后，当任何插件、主题或 WordPress 核心升级时，缓存将自动清除。','Purge All On Upgrade'=>'升级时全部清除','Product Update Interval'=>'产品更新间隔','Determines how changes in product quantity and product stock status affect product pages and their associated category pages.'=>'决定产品数量和产品库存状态的变化如何影响产品页面及其关联的分类页面。','Always purge both product and categories on changes to the quantity or stock status.'=>'数量或库存状态发生变化时，始终同时清除产品和分类。','Do not purge categories on changes to the quantity or stock status.'=>'数量或库存状态发生变化时，不清除分类。','Purge product only when the stock status changes.'=>'仅在库存状态发生变化时清除产品。','Purge product and categories only when the stock status changes.'=>'仅在库存状态发生变化时清除产品和分类。','Purge categories only when stock status changes.'=>'仅在库存状态发生变化时清除分类。','Purge product on changes to the quantity or stock status.'=>'数量或库存状态发生变化时清除产品。','Htaccess did not match configuration option.'=>'.htaccess 与配置选项不匹配。','Specify how long, in seconds, feeds are cached.'=>'指定 Feed 的缓存时长（以秒为单位）。','Default Feed TTL'=>'默认 Feed TTL','Failed to get %s file contents.'=>'无法获取 %s 文件内容。','Disabling this option may negatively affect performance.'=>'停用此选项可能会对性能产生负面影响。','Invalid login cookie. Invalid characters found.'=>'登录 Cookie 无效。发现无效字符。','WARNING: The .htaccess login cookie and Database login cookie do not match.'=>'警告：.htaccess 登录 Cookie 与数据库登录 Cookie 不匹配。','Invalid login cookie. Please check the %s file.'=>'登录 Cookie 无效。请检查 %s 文件。','The cache needs to distinguish who is logged into which WordPress site in order to cache correctly.'=>'为了正确缓存，缓存需要区分谁登录了哪个 WordPress 站点。','There is a WordPress installed for %s.'=>'在 %s 上安装了一个 WordPress。','Example use case:'=>'使用示例：','The cookie set here will be used for this WordPress installation.'=>'此处设置的 Cookie 将用于当前 WordPress 安装。','If every web application uses the same cookie, the server may confuse whether a user is logged in or not.'=>'如果每个 Web 应用程序都使用相同的 Cookie，服务器可能无法分辨用户是否已登录。','This setting is useful for those that have multiple web applications for the same domain.'=>'此设置适用于在同一域名下运行多个 Web 应用程序的用户。','The default login cookie is %s.'=>'默认登录 Cookie 为 %s。','Login Cookie'=>'登录 Cookie','More information about the available commands can be found here.'=>'有关可用命令的更多信息，请参阅此处。','These settings are meant for ADVANCED USERS ONLY.'=>'这些设置仅供高级用户使用。','Current %s Contents'=>'当前 %s 内容','Advanced'=>'高级','Advanced Settings'=>'高级设置','Purge List'=>'清除列表','Purge By...'=>'清除依据……','URL'=>'URL','Tag'=>'标签','Post ID'=>'文章 ID','Category'=>'分类','NOTICE: Database login cookie did not match your login cookie.'=>'注意：数据库登录 Cookie 与您的登录 Cookie 不匹配。','Purge url %s'=>'清除 URL %s','Purge tag %s'=>'清除标签 %s','Purge category %s'=>'清除分类 %s','When disabling the cache, all cached entries for this site will be purged.'=>'停用缓存时，将清除此站点的所有缓存条目。','NOTICE'=>'注意','This setting will edit the .htaccess file.'=>'此设置将编辑 .htaccess 文件。','LiteSpeed Cache View .htaccess'=>'LiteSpeed Cache 查看 .htaccess','Failed to back up %s file, aborted changes.'=>'无法备份 %s 文件，已中止更改。','Do Not Cache Cookies'=>'不缓存的 Cookie','Do Not Cache User Agents'=>'不缓存的 User Agent','This is to ensure compatibility prior to enabling the cache for all sites.'=>'这是为了在为所有站点启用缓存之前确保兼容性。','Network Enable Cache'=>'网络启用缓存','NOTICE:'=>'注意：','Other checkboxes will be ignored.'=>'其他复选框将被忽略。','Select "All" if there are dynamic widgets linked to posts on pages other than the front or home pages.'=>'如果首页或主页以外的页面上有链接到文章的动态小工具，请选择「所有页面」。','List of Mobile User Agents'=>'移动端 User Agent 列表','File %s is not writable.'=>'文件 %s 不可写。','JS Settings'=>'JS 设置','Manage'=>'管理','Default Front Page TTL'=>'默认首页 TTL','Notified LiteSpeed Web Server to purge the front page.'=>'已通知 LiteSpeed Web Server 清除首页。','Purge Front Page'=>'清除首页','Example'=>'示例','All tags are cached by default.'=>'默认缓存所有标签。','All categories are cached by default.'=>'默认缓存所有分类。','To do an exact match, add %s to the end of the URL.'=>'如需精确匹配，请在 URL 末尾添加 %s。','The URLs will be compared to the REQUEST_URI server variable.'=>'这些 URL 将与服务器变量 REQUEST_URI 进行比较。','Select only the archive types that are currently used, the others can be left unchecked.'=>'只需选择当前使用的归档类型，其他类型可保持未选中状态。','Notes'=>'备注','Use Network Admin Setting'=>'使用网络管理设置','Disable'=>'停用','Enabling LiteSpeed Cache for WordPress here enables the cache for the network.'=>'在此处启用 LiteSpeed Cache for WordPress 将为整个网络启用缓存。','Disabled'=>'已停用','Enabled'=>'已启用','Do Not Cache Roles'=>'不缓存的角色','https://www.litespeedtech.com'=>'https://www.litespeedtech.com','LiteSpeed Technologies'=>'LiteSpeed Technologies','LiteSpeed Cache'=>'LiteSpeed Cache','Debug Level'=>'调试级别','Notice'=>'通知','Term archive (include category, tag, and tax)'=>'分类法项目归档（包括分类、标签和分类法）','Daily archive'=>'日归档','Monthly archive'=>'月归档','Yearly archive'=>'年归档','Post type archive'=>'文章类型归档','Author archive'=>'作者归档','Home page'=>'主页','Front page'=>'首页','All pages'=>'所有页面','Select which pages will be automatically purged when posts are published/updated.'=>'选择在文章发布/更新时要自动清除的页面。','Auto Purge Rules For Publish/Update'=>'发布/更新时的自动清除规则','Default Public Cache TTL'=>'默认公共缓存 TTL','seconds'=>'秒','Admin IPs'=>'管理员 IP','General'=>'常规','LiteSpeed Cache Settings'=>'LiteSpeed Cache 设置','Notified LiteSpeed Web Server to purge all LSCache entries.'=>'已通知 LiteSpeed Web Server 清除所有 LSCache 条目。','Purge All'=>'全部清除','Settings'=>'设置','Support forum'=>'支持论坛']];